    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300eWIENER COFFEE\u300f Watch the wiener fly! Aiming for the coffee cup\u2014!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eWIENER COFFEE\u300fis a 3D action game where you guide a wiener protagonist on an adventure through various environments to reach a coffee cup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump activates the moment you land, creating an addictive control feel. Master the timing and momentum to push forward to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall to the floor and you'll start over! But the simplicity makes you want to try again and again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls with just jumping, making it fun for everyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique atmosphere and gimmicks that change with each stage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep an eye on the wiener's movements\u2014slightly surreal and somehow endearing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game packed with the charm of &quot;jump &amp; retry&quot;\u2014simple yet deep, where even mistakes make you laugh. Can you safely guide the wiener to the coffee cup?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message for video creators and streamers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Cobalt Tree Monitor welcomes content creation and monetization using</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eWIENER COFFEE\u300f Please play the game and feel free to enjoy it however you like!</strong></p>",
